Baylee memorial (26 October 2026): the login/lobby performs Claude Debussy's
Clair de lune and Erik Satie's Gymnopédie No. 1. These public-domain works use
public-domain Mutopia editions by Keith OHara and Evin Robertson, respectively.
Exact source files, edition links and hashes are in art/music/memorial/.
The program renders a new performance; no third-party performance is copied.

The memorial's Yamaha C2 grand-piano recordings are Osiris Piano, by Versilian
Studios and Karoryfer Samples, CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://shop.karoryfer.com/pages/free-osiris-piano
https://github.com/sfzinstruments/Osiris_Piano
Revision: 18c6afccb60cff458edbf7c394571783e074e1e9.
Solo violin and cello recordings are VSCO 2 Community Edition (credits above),
revision 440300901dfe9275fd84e0b7763af1f8443ae62e, also CC0 1.0 Universal.
Unmodified legal texts are in crates/baylee-client-core/assets/chamber/;
source/PCM hashes, stereo preparation and licensing details are documented in
art/music/memorial/instruments.json and README.md.
The memorial photographs were supplied and authorized for this album by
Baylee's owner. Generated memorial scenery and both Baylee logos use those
references; see art/baylee/README.md for provenance.
